<mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;UI improvements: task dependencies&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Which tasks (one PR each) can run side by side. Arrows mean &quot;must be merged first&quot;. T4 onward waits for base-plan M5.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1200" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
