<mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read this&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Green = U0/U0b (can land before M5 finishes). Blue = U1&amp;ndash;U3 (start after M5). Orange = final docs/exit check.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; T1 first; then T2 and T3 in parallel. After M5: T4, T5, T7, T9 are independent.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Longest chains (5 PRs): T1 &amp;rarr; T5 &amp;rarr; T6 &amp;rarr; T8 &amp;rarr; T13 and T1 &amp;rarr; T3 &amp;rarr; T11 &amp;rarr; T12 &amp;rarr; T13." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="820" width="900" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>